schema_spec:
Canonical wrapper for structured response when function calling is enabled:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "response_type": {"enum": ["text", "function_call"]},
    "content": {"oneOf": [ {"type": "string"}, {"type": "object"} ] },
    "meta": {"type": "object", "properties": {"timestamp": {"type": "string"}, "model": {"type": "string"} } }
  },
  "required": ["response_type", "content"]
}
Function call envelope when response_type == 'function_call':
{
  "function_id": "string",
  "name": "string",
  "args": { /* must validate against registered JSON Schema */ }
}
Note: All schemas must be machine-parseable and made available via the /schemas endpoint for SDKs and Console.
